msgstr "Discard proposal"

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:8
msgid "Proveedor de IA"
msgstr "AI provider"

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:15
msgid "Otro (URL manual)"
msgstr "Other (manual URL)"

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:18
msgid ""
"Groq es gratis. Los demás son de pago, con la cuenta que ya tengas en ese"
" proveedor. Otro sirve para cualquier proveedor no listado que hable el "
"mismo formato de API."
msgstr ""
"Groq is free. The others are paid, using your existing account with that "
"provider. Other works for any unlisted provider that speaks the same API "
"format."

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:20
msgid "Crea una cuenta gratis en console.groq.com"
msgstr "Create a free account at console.groq.com"

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:26 ancla/web/templates/settings.html:73
msgid "Clave de API"
msgstr "API key"

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:30
msgid "Ya tienes una clave guardada."
msgstr "You already have a key saved."

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:30
msgid "Todavía no has configurado ninguna clave."
msgstr "You haven't set up a key yet."

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:31
msgid "Las claves de Groq empiezan por gsk_."
msgstr "Groq keys start with gsk_."

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:36
msgid "Modelo"
msgstr "Model"

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:39
msgid "El nombre exacto del modelo tal cual lo espera ese proveedor."
msgstr "The exact model name that provider expects."

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:43
msgid "URL base"
msgstr "Base URL"

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:46
msgid ""
"La dirección que te dé la documentación de tu proveedor. Los demás ya la "
"llevan puesta."
msgstr ""
"The address given in your provider's documentation. The other providers "
"already have theirs set."

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:50
msgid "Idioma de la interfaz"
msgstr "Interface language"

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:58
msgid "Guardar ajustes"
msgstr "Save settings"

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:63
msgid "Límite diario del nivel gratuito de Groq"
msgstr "Daily limit on Groq's free tier"

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:65
msgid ""
"El nivel gratuito de Groq permite 30 peticiones por minuto, 1.000 "
"peticiones al día, 8.000 tokens por minuto y"
msgstr ""
"Groq's free tier allows 30 requests per minute, 1,000 requests per day, "
"8,000 tokens per minute and"

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:66
msgid "200.000 tokens al día"
msgstr "200,000 tokens per day"

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:66
msgid ""
"Cada adaptación o importación de CV es una sola petición, pero puede "
"gastar varios miles de tokens, así que el límite que más se nota con uso "
"normal es el diario, no el de cada minuto."
msgstr ""
"Each CV adaptation or import is a single request, but it can use several "
"thousand tokens, so with normal use the daily limit is the one you'll "
"notice, not the per-minute one."

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:69
msgid ""
"Si ves el aviso \"Has agotado la cuota gratuita de Groq\", casi siempre "
"es este límite diario. Groq no indica cuánto queda exactamente, y se "
"libera poco a poco a lo largo de 24 horas, no de golpe. Puede tardar "
"bastante más que unos minutos en volver a funcionar."
msgstr ""
"If you see the message “You've used up your Groq free quota”, it's almost"
" always this daily limit. Groq doesn't show exactly how much is left, and"
" it's released gradually over 24 hours, not all at once. It can take a "
"good deal longer than a few minutes to work again."

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:72
msgid ""
"Como cada cuenta de Groq gratuita tiene su propio límite independiente, "
"una forma sencilla de no quedarte nunca sin margen es crear una segunda "
"cuenta gratuita (con otro correo) y generar otra clave. Cuando se agote "
"la que tienes puesta aquí, pega la otra en"
msgstr ""
"Since each free Groq account has its own independent limit, a simple way "
"to never run out of headroom is to create a second free account (with "
"another email address) and generate another key. When the one you have "
"here runs out, paste the other one in"

#: ancla/web/templates/settings.html:73
msgid "y sigue trabajando mientras la primera se recupera."
msgstr "and carry on working while the first one recovers."

#: ancla/web/templates/skill_form.html:2 ancla/web/templates/skill_form.html:4
msgid "Nueva skill"
msgstr "New skill"

#: ancla/web/templates/skill_form.html:2 ancla/web/templates/skill_form.html:4
msgid "Editar skill"
msgstr "Edit skill"

#: ancla/web/templates/skill_form.html:40
msgid "lenguaje, cloud, dato..."
msgstr "language, cloud, data..."

#: ancla/web/templates/skill_form.html:48
msgid ""
"Las propone la IA a partir del nombre y la categoría. No salen nunca en "
"tu CV, sirven para reconocer esta skill cuando una oferta la nombre de "
"otra forma. Revísalas y añade las que falten."
msgstr ""
"These are suggested by the AI from the name and category. They never "
"appear on your CV; they're used to recognise this skill when a job "
"posting names it differently. Review them and add any that are missing."

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:4
msgid "Hablemos"
msgstr "Let's talk"

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:6
msgid ""
"Este proyecto es open source y se hace mejor con lo que cuentes: un "
"fallo, una idea, o simplemente algo que no te haya quedado claro. No hace"
" falta que sea un bug para que merezca la pena escribirlo. Se lee todo."
msgstr ""
"This project is open source and gets better with what you share: a bug, "
"an idea, or just something that wasn't clear to you. It doesn't have to "
"be a bug to be worth writing in about. Everything gets read."

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:11
msgid "¿Qué es esto?"
msgstr "What's this about?"

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:25
msgid "Asunto (opcional)"
msgstr "Subject (optional)"

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:26
msgid "Resumen breve, si quieres ponerlo"
msgstr "A short summary, if you'd like to add one"

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:29
msgid "Mensaje"
msgstr "Message"

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:31
msgid ""
"Qué esperabas que pasara y qué ha pasado en su lugar. Si puedes, los "
"pasos para reproducirlo."
msgstr ""
"What you expected to happen and what happened instead. Steps to reproduce"
" it, if you can."

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:32 ancla/web/templates/support.html:33
msgid ""
"Qué mejorarías, qué echas en falta, o qué te ha resultado confuso. "
"Cualquier cosa vale."
msgstr ""
"What you'd improve, what you're missing, or what you found confusing. "
"Anything counts."

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:38
msgid "Abrir incidencia en GitHub"
msgstr "Open an issue on GitHub"

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:39
msgid "Enviar por correo"
msgstr "Send by email"

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:42
msgid ""
"es público y queda buscable, ideal si otras personas pueden tener el "
"mismo problema."
msgstr ""
"is public and searchable, ideal if other people might run into the same "
"issue."

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:43
msgid "El correo"
msgstr "Email"

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:43
msgid ""
"es privado, solo lo lee Daniel. Elige el que prefieras, los dos llegan "
"igual."
msgstr ""
"is private, only Daniel reads it. Pick whichever you prefer, both reach "
"the same place."

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:49
msgid "Tu mensaje se guarda primero en tu ordenador, en"
msgstr "Your message is saved first on your computer, in"

#: ancla/web/templates/support.html:49
msgid ""
"antes de intentar enviarlo a ningún sitio. Solo se adjunta diagnóstico "
"técnico (versión, sistema, proveedor de IA), nunca datos de tu perfil."
msgstr ""
"before it tries to send it anywhere. Only technical diagnostics are "
"attached (version, system, AI provider), never your profile data."

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:6
msgid ""
"Sin letra pequeña rara, esto es exactamente lo que la app hace con tus "
"datos, no más."
msgstr ""
"No odd small print: this is exactly what the app does with your data, "
"nothing more."

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:10
msgid "Tus datos no salen de tu ordenador"
msgstr "Your data never leaves your computer"

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:12
msgid ""
"Tu perfil, tus CVs guardados y tus ajustes viven en ficheros de texto en "
"tu propio ordenador. No hay cuentas, no hay servidor de este proyecto "
"donde se guarde nada tuyo, no hay analítica ni telemetría. Nadie del "
"proyecto puede ver tu perfil ni saber que existe, no hay ningún sitio al "
"que llegue."
msgstr ""
"Your profile, your saved CVs and your settings live in text files on your"
" own computer. There are no accounts, no server run by this project where"
" anything of yours is stored, no analytics and no telemetry. No one "
"involved in the project can see your profile or even know it exists — "
"there's nowhere for it to go."

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:17
msgid "La única llamada de red la haces tú, con tu propia clave"
msgstr "The only network call is one you make yourself, with your own key"

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:19
msgid ""
"Cuando adaptas un CV o importas uno nuevo, tu navegador envía el texto "
"necesario (tu perfil relevante, la vacante, o el CV que subes) "
"directamente al proveedor de IA que has configurado en Ajustes (Groq por "
"defecto), con la clave de API que tú mismo has generado. No pasa por "
"ningún servidor intermedio de este proyecto porque no existe tal "
"servidor."
msgstr ""
"When you adapt a CV or import a new one, your browser sends the necessary"
" text (your relevant profile, the job posting, or the CV you upload) "
"directly to the AI provider you've set up in Settings (Groq by default), "
"using the API key you generated yourself. It doesn't pass through any "
"intermediate server run by this project, because no such server exists."

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:22
msgid ""
"La tipografía de la app está alojada en local por el mismo motivo. Ni "
"siquiera cargar una fuente debería avisar a un tercero de que has abierto"
" la app."
msgstr ""
"The app's typeface is hosted locally for the same reason. Not even "
"loading a font should let a third party know you've opened the app."

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:27
msgid "Soporte: tú eliges si algo se hace público"
msgstr "Support: you choose if anything becomes public"

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:29
msgid "Si escribes en"
msgstr "If you write in to"

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:29
msgid ""
"puedes elegir entre GitHub o correo. El correo es privado, solo lo lee "
"Daniel. GitHub es público, se te abre un formulario ya rellenado, pero es"
" tuyo publicarlo o no. Tú decides si pulsas «Crear incidencia». En ningún"
" caso se incluye tu clave de API ni el contenido de tu perfil, solo tu "
"mensaje y datos técnicos básicos (sistema operativo, versión, proveedor)."
msgstr ""
"you can choose between GitHub or email. Email is private, only Daniel "
"reads it. GitHub is public — a pre-filled form opens for you, but it's up"
" to you whether to post it. You decide whether to click “Create issue”. "
"Your API key and profile content are never included, only your message "
"and basic technical details (operating system, version, provider)."

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:34
msgid "Puedes comprobarlo tú mismo"
msgstr "You can check this yourself"

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:36
msgid "Esta página es un resumen, no la fuente de la verdad. El proyecto es"
msgstr "This page is a summary, not the source of truth. The project is"

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:37
msgid "código abierto"
msgstr "open source"

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:37
msgid ""
"así que no hace falta que confíes en lo que dice esta página. Puedes leer"
" exactamente qué hace cada línea con tus datos."
msgstr ""
"so you don't need to take this page's word for it. You can read exactly "
"what every line does with your data."

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:42
msgid "Sin garantía, como cualquier software libre"
msgstr "No warranty, like any free software"

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:44
msgid "La app se distribuye bajo licencia AGPL-3.0, incluida en el fichero"
msgstr "The app is distributed under the AGPL-3.0 licence, included in the"

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:44
msgid "del"
msgstr "file in the"

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:45
msgid "repositorio"
msgstr "repository"

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:45
msgid ""
"Se ofrece «tal cual», sin garantía de ningún tipo. Es gratis, se puede "
"usar, copiar y modificar libremente. Si ofreces una versión modificada "
"como servicio en red, debes publicar también tus cambios; nadie responde "
"por lo que hagas con ella ni por los fallos que tenga."
msgstr ""
"It's provided “as is”, with no warranty of any kind. It's free, and "
"you're free to use, copy and modify it. If you run a modified version as "
"a network service, you must publish your changes too; no one is liable "
"for what you do with it or for any bugs it may have."

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:50
msgid "La única cookie es técnica, no de seguimiento"
msgstr "The only cookie is a technical one, not a tracking one"

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:52
msgid ""
"La app usa una cookie de sesión (de Flask, el servidor que la hace "
"funcionar) solo para mostrarte avisos de una pantalla a otra, por ejemplo"
" cuando guardas algo. No identifica a nadie, no rastrea nada y no sale de"
" tu ordenador, así que no hace falta pedirte consentimiento para usarla."
msgstr ""
"The app uses a session cookie (from Flask, the server that runs it) only "
"to show you notices from one screen to the next, for example when you "
"save something. It doesn't identify anyone, doesn't track anything, and "
"never leaves your computer, so there's no need to ask for your consent to"
" use it."

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:57
msgid "Quién mantiene este proyecto"
msgstr "Who maintains this project"

#: ancla/web/templates/terms.html:59
msgid "Ancla lo mantiene Daniel Vega Rosado. Para cualquier duda que no encaje en"
msgstr ""
"Ancla is maintained by Daniel Vega Rosado. For anything that doesn't fit "
"under"

