#: ancla/web/views/settings.py:30
msgid ""
"El proveedor personalizado no está disponible en esta demo pública (evita"
" que el servidor compartido llame a direcciones arbitrarias). Prueba con "
"Groq, OpenAI, Mistral, OpenRouter o Anthropic."
msgstr ""
"The custom provider isn't available in this public demo (it keeps the "
"shared server from calling arbitrary addresses). Try Groq, OpenAI, "
"Mistral, OpenRouter, or Anthropic."

#: ancla/web/views/settings.py:57
msgid ""
"Esa clave no empieza por «gsk_», que es el formato de Groq. Si la "
"conseguiste en console.x.ai en vez de console.groq.com, es de Grok (xAI) "
"y no funcionará aquí: son proveedores distintos."
msgstr ""
"That key doesn't start with “gsk_”, which is Groq's format. If you got it"
" from console.x.ai instead of console.groq.com, it's a Grok (xAI) key and"
" won't work here — they're different providers."

#: ancla/web/views/settings.py:62
msgid "Ajustes guardados."
msgstr "Settings saved."

#: ancla/web/views/support.py:35
msgid "Cuéntanos qué ha pasado, o qué se te ha ocurrido, antes de enviarlo."
msgstr "Tell us what happened, or what came to mind, before sending it."

